{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ScreenEnd","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ScreenEnd","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This event is tracked automatically before each "},{"code":"ScreenView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" event when screen engagement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking is enabled, closing out the engagement summary for the previous screen."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It can also be tracked manually to end the current screen without starting a new one –","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for instance when a WebView is presented over a native screen, or when a screen is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dismissed without a subsequent screen view being tracked. Tracking it manually stops the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"engagement timer for the current screen and attaches the ","type":"text"},{"code":"screen_summary","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entity.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After the screen ends, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"screen"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"screen_summary"},{"type":"text","text":" entities are no longer attached to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subsequent events until the next "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenView"},{"type":"text","text":". The next "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenView"},{"type":"text","text":" still references the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ended screen in its previous screen fields and no further "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenEnd"},{"type":"text","text":" is tracked for it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The event is not tracked if there is no current screen to end.","type":"text"}]}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/SelfDescribingAbstract"],"kind":"relationships","type":"inheritsFrom","title":"Inherits From"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/objc(pl)NSObject","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/s7CVarArgP","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/s28CustomDebugStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/SQ","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/SH"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Event tracked when a screen is no longer visible to the user.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Class","role":"symbol","title":"ScreenEnd","symbolKind":"class","modules":[{"name":"SnowplowTracker"}],"externalID":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)ScreenEnd","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScreenEnd"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScreenEnd"}]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker"]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ScreenEnd\/init()"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/screenend"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://SnowplowTracker/SH":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Hashable","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/SH"},"doc://SnowplowTracker/objc(pl)NSObject":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"ObjectiveC.NSObjectProtocol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/objc(pl)NSObject"},"doc://SnowplowTr